OBD-II Diagnostic Trouble Codes, generic SAE J2012 list

Code data from OBD Codes List, https://obdcodeslist.com/code-data.html

Free to use, including commercially. One condition: keep the attribution line
above somewhere in the product or the documentation, and link to the page
rather than to the file, so people land on the current version.

The data is provided as is, with no warranty. Confirm a code against the
vehicle and live scan data before replacing any part.
